      "text": "Context Managment\nThe main way we will give information to the \nagents is  via a context manager class\n\nThe goal of this class is we would create a context \nobject of some type (ex: temp) continous",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Context Managment\nThe main way we will give information to the \nagents is  via a context manager class\n\nThe goal of this class is we would create a context \nobject of some type (ex: temp) continous",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
